        "topic": "manufacturing",
        "passage": "Man: The shipping box labels show the letter R, then the number eight. The units inside show the letter R, then the number nine. I have stopped the shipment.\nWoman: Keep the boxes in the marked holding area. Compare the labels with the packing list.\nMan: The list is correct. The label printer may have used an old template.\nWoman: Let’s check the print history. Do not relabel anything until the quality team approves the correction.",
        "passageZh": "男：出貨紙箱上的標籤先顯示字母 R，再顯示數字 8。箱內產品的標示則是字母 R，接著是數字 9。我已停止出貨。\n女：把紙箱留在有標示的暫存區。請比對標籤與裝箱單。\n男：裝箱單沒錯。印表機可能用了舊版標籤樣板。\n女：先查列印紀錄。品管部門核准更正之前，不要重貼任何標籤。",
        "audioScript": "The shipping box labels show the letter R, then the number eight. The units inside show the letter R, then the number nine. I have stopped the shipment.\nKeep the boxes in the marked holding area. Compare the labels with the packing list.\nThe list is correct. The label printer may have used an old template.\nLet’s check the print history. Do not relabel anything until the quality team approves the correction.",
        "turns": [
          {
            "voice": "male",
            "text": "The shipping box labels show the letter R, then the number eight. The units inside show the letter R, then the number nine. I have stopped the shipment."
          },
