            "text": "Keep the boxes in the marked holding area. Compare the labels with the packing list."
          },
          {
            "voice": "male",
            "text": "The list is correct. The label printer may have used an old template."
          },
          {
            "voice": "female",
            "text": "Let’s check the print history. Do not relabel anything until the quality team approves the correction."
          }
